@tappass/dsh-governance README · TapPass governance for DeepSeek Harness：**The authority layer for agentic AI, as a DeepSeek Harness plugin.**

Everything in DeepSeek Harness is a plugin. This is the one that decides what
your agents are allowed to do.

@tappass/dsh-governance README · TapPass governance for DeepSeek Harness：This plugin intercepts every tool call at the harness's `tools/pre-execute`
seam, sends it to the TapPass policy decision point (`POST /v1/govern`), and
allows, denies, or escalates it for human approval.
